	(text_box "This design is a derivative work of John Winans S-100 bus logic analyzer targeted for RCBUS instead of S-100 bus.\nhttps://github.com/johnwinans/2070-S-100-bus-analyzer\n\nBoth projects use the Dr Gusman software and firmware.\nhttps://github.com/gusmanb/logicanalyzer"
